#: src/Admin/Views/pages/integrations.php:113
msgid "A submission is flagged when ANY threshold is met: (1) abuse confidence score, (2) total community reports across all categories, (3) reports filed under the \"Email Spam\" category. Note: the API returns per-category data only for the most recent reports of an IP (verbose mode), so threshold 3 counts recent Email-Spam reports — a close approximation of the full category history. Set any threshold to 0 to disable it. IPs whitelisted upstream always pass."
msgstr "任一阈值被触发即标记为垃圾：(1) 滥用置信度分数；(2) 全部类别的社区举报总数；(3)“Email Spam”类别下的举报数。注意：API 仅在 verbose 模式下返回该 IP 最近若干条举报的分类数据，因此阈值 3 统计的是最近的 Email Spam 举报——是完整分类历史的良好近似。将任一阈值设为 0 可将其禁用。上游白名单 IP 始终放行。"

